*1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.67 seconds<sup>20f~50f</sup>.
