==Strategy==
Begin by stalling The Face with a cheap meatshield such as [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]]. Then, once the first Cala Maria spawns, lure her to the cat base. Kill the Brollows with high DPH attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], then burst down Cala Maria with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]]. The stage will be far simpler to handle after getting rid of one of the primary lingering threats early on. At this point, try to go for as much damage on The Face before the second Cala Maria spawns. Once she does, Cats with pierce like [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] that outrange The Face are very effective in chipping the bosses down while sniping the Brollows.

